// Title: Brute-force logon attempts
// Source: Log Analytics
// Tables: SecurityEvent
// When to use: Spike in failed logons against one machine, or one IP trying many accounts.
// Tune: Needs SecurityEvent collection (Defender for Cloud or Sentinel). 20 attempts per hour is the line here.

SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where EventID == 4625
| summarize Attempts = count(), Accounts = dcount(TargetAccount), SampleAccounts = make_set(TargetAccount, 5) by IpAddress, Computer
| where Attempts > 20
| order by Attempts desc
